        <mxCell id="gates" value="&lt;b&gt;Mandatory pipeline gates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Lint and type check&lt;br&gt;• Unit tests&lt;br&gt;• OpenAPI validation&lt;br&gt;• Permission test coverage&lt;br&gt;• Tenant isolation test coverage&lt;br&gt;• Dependency vulnerability threshold&lt;br&gt;• Container vulnerability threshold&lt;br&gt;• No detected secrets&lt;br&gt;• Signed and immutable build artifact" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEE2E2;strokeColor=#DC2626;fontColor=#7F1D1D;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
